  "body": "Is there any place where financial reports of The Matrix.org Foundation are published? Like, summary of income through donations, who is currently employed by The Matrix.org Foundation and how are funds spent outside of employments.\r\n\r\nIf such information already is public, I think it makes sense to link it on https://matrix.org/foundation/\r\nIf such information is not public yet, please consider to do it. After all, an organization collecting \r\ndonations should make clear to some degree how those funds are used.",
